{"data": [{"author_id": "289688566", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:41:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120316048511848905"], "id": "2120316048511848905", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120308581694378412", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey https://t.co/23UW187k7Y", "url": "https://x.com/ai_pmer/status/2120316048511848905"}, {"author_id": "1694943359255957504", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:27:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120312408615100610"], "id": "2120312408615100610", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 白板和表格一起改，确实方便。不过它们是在 Claude 的云上协作，数据不在自己的网盘里。\n\n企业要是把客户名单、报价放进去，得先确认这份内容能不能出境，以及能不能关掉训练使用。协作很顺，可验收不能写成「表格在我们自己的服务器上」。", "url": "https://x.com/linxlbuilds/status/2120312408615100610"}, {"author_id": "575108052", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:22:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120311079578255417"], "id": "2120311079578255417", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 白板这块挺实用的，尤其是能框住一块区域单独提问、讨论完直接转文档或幻灯片，复盘会不用再截图到处贴了。而且这次 Pro 也在范围内，比 ChatGPT Space 只给高阶套餐大方，等分批推送到了试试多人实时改顺不顺手。", "url": "https://x.com/wybucm1/status/2120311079578255417"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:18:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120310279506641170"], "id": "2120310279506641170", "in_reply_to_user_id": "12480452", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120308664447930578", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@yaoeryi 有dsh插件，看图片上的repo地址", "url": "https://x.com/dotey/status/2120310279506641170"}, {"author_id": "12480452", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:12:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120308664447930578"], "id": "2120308664447930578", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120274628039864349", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey deepseek也有？怎么装，宝玉老师", "url": "https://x.com/yaoeryi/status/2120308664447930578"}, {"author_id": "2063647126819868673", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:06:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120307094012522683"], "id": "2120307094012522683", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 白板这个对学生太友好了吧，小组作业终于不用在群里来回传截图了。就是付费才能用有点肉疼，希望早点出学生优惠🥲", "url": "https://x.com/Jonasxu000/status/2120307094012522683"}, {"author_id": "2053775399369490432", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120298201362170048"], "id": "2120298201362170048", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey Sheets 能多人一起改的话，让 Claude 做完表就不用再导出来发群里了", "url": "https://x.com/JiaoWoDaDiao69/status/2120298201362170048"}, {"author_id": "1995879937442807810", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:02:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120290946680332701"], "id": "2120290946680332701", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey “认证查询”这个太实用了，终于不用开会先花半小时争论到底该信谁的数字了……", "url": "https://x.com/ATHENAFundAnn/status/2120290946680332701"}, {"author_id": "1126207424602337280", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:58:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120274827579977778"], "id": "2120274827579977778", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey Pro 也能用是关键，比 ChatGPT Space 门槛低一截。但白板表格真正的对手不是功能，是微软基本盘：Excel 协作和企业数据接入。Claude Data 得连数据源才有价值，IT 采购那关才是胜负手。你会拿它替代 Excel 做协作吗？", "url": "https://x.com/TheEasySale1/status/2120274827579977778"}, {"author_id": "3178231", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:57:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120274628039864349"], "id": "2120274628039864349", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 2354, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "如果你没有 claude 账号想测试 Claude Whiteboards 的话，可以试试 DSH 插件 https://t.co/Qo3NaWJQrU", "url": "https://x.com/dotey/status/2120274628039864349"}, {"author_id": "4756567844", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120252796897472535"], "id": "2120252796897472535", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 🖍️多了白板和表格两样，看板也另起了名字，几个人一起改东西省事些", "url": "https://x.com/cloudi66/status/2120252796897472535"}, {"author_id": "1504955609619177475", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:26:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120251859030212732"], "id": "2120251859030212732", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 163, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 这是和微软谷歌竞争.\n\n谁愿意把自己的数据绑定在一家平台上?\nClaude Data 应该向谷歌学习, 免费提供服务.\n这样才能吸引更多人订阅 Claude AI.", "url": "https://x.com/chaojidigua/status/2120251859030212732"}, {"author_id": "1689098925159149569", "created_at": "2026-11-10T20:00:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120245190107758881"], "id": "2120245190107758881", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey I tried Claude Whiteboards with a team last week. It's great for brainstorming, but the latency is still high—around 3-5 seconds for each input. Definitely a work in progress.", "url": "https://x.com/chengfu588728/status/2120245190107758881"}, {"author_id": "1891833767519715329", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:57:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120244505777414529"], "id": "2120244505777414529", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120213189464105192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey Anthropic这是铁了心把Claude往企业级工作台推，生怕大家只把它当纯聊天框。白板和表格都是奔着抢Notion和Excel饭碗去的，看来下半场大模型决胜点全在工作流嵌合度。", "url": "https://x.com/YunTechX/status/2120244505777414529"}, {"author_id": "1216167367958355968", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:04:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120231183401517306"], "id": "2120231183401517306", "in_reply_to_